1
00:00:23,744 --> 00:00:28,483
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,483 --> 00:00:32,195
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,419 --> 00:00:34,664
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:35,011 --> 00:00:37,718
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,597 --> 00:00:43,125
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:43,125 --> 00:00:46,757
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,235 --> 00:00:50,723
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,867 --> 00:00:55,363
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,363 --> 00:01:00,003
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,391 --> 00:01:02,051
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:02,051 --> 00:01:08,003
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,195 --> 00:01:11,883
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:11,883 --> 00:01:15,454
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,619 --> 00:01:22,563
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:23,011 --> 00:01:26,632
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,632 --> 00:01:30,316
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,403 --> 00:01:35,331
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,331 --> 00:01:39,491
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,235 --> 00:01:46,787
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,331 --> 00:01:49,987
=Episode 20=

21
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,640
(If hatred can keep you alive,)

22
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:04,519
(I hope you loathe me deeply.)

23
00:02:05,640 --> 00:02:07,040
(This path is too dangerous.)

24
00:02:08,360 --> 00:02:09,840
(I should walk it alone.)

25
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,980
The latest telegram has been decoded.

26
00:02:42,023 --> 00:02:43,497
General Kakeo wants the Feng Mausoleum

27
00:02:43,497 --> 00:02:45,111
Treasure Map in Buddha Head
in three days.

28
00:02:46,819 --> 00:02:47,319
(Get the Treasure Map in three days)

29
00:02:47,319 --> 00:02:49,759
General Kakeo also stressed
this is the final deadline.

30
00:02:50,319 --> 00:02:52,400
Or we will bear the consequences.

31
00:02:54,639 --> 00:02:55,680
Reply immediately.

32
00:02:56,159 --> 00:02:57,520
The key to the Buddha Head,

33
00:02:57,520 --> 00:02:59,240
the kingfisher phoenix crown,
is in our hands.

34
00:02:59,360 --> 00:03:01,240
We'll have the treasure map in no time.

35
00:03:01,879 --> 00:03:03,120
We'll make sure it gets done.

36
00:03:03,199 --> 00:03:04,000
Yes.

37
00:03:27,120 --> 00:03:27,919
Let's go.

38
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:30,360
Without the Buddha Head in three days,
we will all die.

39
00:03:39,759 --> 00:03:40,560
Governor.

40
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:43,520
You said you killed Xu You'an?

41
00:03:43,639 --> 00:03:45,439
Governor, this item is proof.

42
00:03:45,439 --> 00:03:46,479
I dare not fake it.

43
00:03:46,479 --> 00:03:49,000
Please reward me with the hundred gold.

44
00:03:50,639 --> 00:03:52,000
This thing alone is not enough.

45
00:03:52,439 --> 00:03:54,879
Once I see the head of Xu You'an,

46
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:57,120
you'll get your money.

47
00:03:58,680 --> 00:03:59,479
Governor,

48
00:04:00,400 --> 00:04:03,439
I've seen
plenty of double-crossing tricks.

49
00:04:04,120 --> 00:04:05,639
I need to see the money first.

50
00:04:05,879 --> 00:04:06,680
Nowadays...

51
00:04:06,680 --> 00:04:08,120
Cut the crap. Lead the way.

52
00:04:11,560 --> 00:04:12,800
Please, Governor.

53
00:04:13,039 --> 00:04:14,080
Please.

54
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,800
Please, Governor.

55
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,199
(Xu Fan,)

56
00:04:34,800 --> 00:04:40,040
(this hundred gold will be your toll
on the way to the underworld.)

57
00:04:41,959 --> 00:04:43,879
Governor, it's right ahead.

58
00:04:46,639 --> 00:04:48,560
I buried his head right here.

59
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:51,439
I'll trouble you soldiers
to dig it up yourselves.

60
00:04:54,560 --> 00:04:58,199
Governor, shouldn't you give me...

61
00:04:58,720 --> 00:04:59,519
You know.

62
00:05:04,920 --> 00:05:05,920
Thank you.

63
00:05:08,759 --> 00:05:09,560
Dig it up.

64
00:06:31,680 --> 00:06:32,959
Don't forget.

65
00:06:33,480 --> 00:06:37,319
It was I who taught you the Art of War.

66
00:06:52,720 --> 00:06:54,639
The Governor expected this from you.

67
00:06:54,759 --> 00:06:56,600
So he had me wait in the wings.

68
00:07:05,360 --> 00:07:08,959
Go. Inform the Xiaosheng Society

69
00:07:09,639 --> 00:07:14,040
that I've captured Xu You'an.

70
00:07:16,279 --> 00:07:18,839
Make sure Rong Xiaonan hears it.

71
00:07:33,399 --> 00:07:34,199
Mr. Du.

72
00:07:38,480 --> 00:07:41,439
Mr. Rong, you've rested enough.

73
00:07:42,560 --> 00:07:45,439
Can you take me
to find the Jade Buddha Head now?

74
00:07:46,839 --> 00:07:48,959
Since I agreed to cooperate with you,

75
00:07:49,959 --> 00:07:52,759
I will certainly do my best.

76
00:07:53,480 --> 00:07:54,439
But...

77
00:07:59,680 --> 00:08:01,319
Mr. Rong, say what you need to.

78
00:08:01,800 --> 00:08:05,160
After all, we are friends.

79
00:08:14,800 --> 00:08:20,240
Have you ever wondered
why the Buddha Head became a fake one

80
00:08:20,680 --> 00:08:21,959
once it reached Xu Fan?

81
00:08:23,279 --> 00:08:27,079
And why the crown went missing
once it passed through Xu Fan's hands?

82
00:08:31,079 --> 00:08:33,759
Xu Fan has entrenched himself
in Fengcheng for decades.

83
00:08:34,240 --> 00:08:35,639
He is extremely cunning

84
00:08:36,600 --> 00:08:38,120
and ruthless.

85
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:42,600
Since Xu Fan had the ability
to retake the Governor Mansion,

86
00:08:43,240 --> 00:08:46,600
then why did he let Xu You'an
run rampant for so long

87
00:08:47,240 --> 00:08:49,000
and even allow your society
to be ransacked?

88
00:08:52,759 --> 00:08:56,879
Mr. Rong, your tactic of sowing discord
is cleverly used.

89
00:08:57,440 --> 00:08:59,399
I am indeed tempted.

90
00:09:00,000 --> 00:09:02,080
But let me make it clear to you,

91
00:09:02,679 --> 00:09:04,799
whoever helps me
find the Jade Buddha Head

92
00:09:05,799 --> 00:09:07,000
is my friend.

93
00:09:14,519 --> 00:09:19,240
Then I'm afraid you might only
be able to befriend me.

94
00:09:21,039 --> 00:09:21,840
Sir,

95
00:09:22,039 --> 00:09:23,279
Governor Mansion sent someone.

96
00:09:23,679 --> 00:09:24,679
Let him in.

97
00:09:24,679 --> 00:09:25,399
Yes.

98
00:09:33,120 --> 00:09:34,799
What does Governor Xu want?

99
00:09:35,080 --> 00:09:35,879
Mr. Du,

100
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:38,159
the Governor has captured
the traitor Xu You'an.

101
00:09:38,519 --> 00:09:39,960
He invites you over to witness it.

102
00:09:39,960 --> 00:09:42,480
Alright. I'll be there shortly.

103
00:09:57,279 --> 00:10:00,039
Would you like to come along, Mr. Rong?

104
00:10:06,200 --> 00:10:07,000
Of course.

105
00:10:08,159 --> 00:10:12,399
Xu Fan is doing so as a warning to you.

106
00:10:12,840 --> 00:10:16,279
I must be present for this good show.

107
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:21,919
If I were you,
I would protect Xu You'an.

108
00:10:22,799 --> 00:10:25,360
Having someone who can restrain Xu Fan

109
00:10:25,559 --> 00:10:27,080
will keep the cooperation balanced.

110
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:30,039
If he has no rivals left in Fengcheng,

111
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:32,799
then the next one
to be devoured entirely

112
00:10:33,879 --> 00:10:35,600
will be you, Mr. Du.

113
00:10:40,679 --> 00:10:42,360
Why should I believe you?

114
00:10:43,720 --> 00:10:44,559
Mr. Du,

115
00:10:45,399 --> 00:10:48,759
now everyone knows
I am your honored guest.

116
00:10:49,519 --> 00:10:51,120
But once we get there,

117
00:10:51,720 --> 00:10:54,879
Xu Fan will definitely kill Xu You'an.

118
00:10:55,639 --> 00:10:58,240
He will also demand my death.

119
00:10:59,679 --> 00:11:02,679
Because his trusted man
saw me and the phoenix crown

120
00:11:03,320 --> 00:11:05,559
at your place together.

121
00:11:06,279 --> 00:11:07,559
Once I am dead,

122
00:11:08,200 --> 00:11:11,080
the Buddha Head will forever remain
in Xu Fan's territory.

123
00:11:11,799 --> 00:11:15,519
I don't know what's exactly so good
about these two treasures

124
00:11:16,320 --> 00:11:18,240
that you two are so obsessed with them.

125
00:11:18,919 --> 00:11:22,840
But if these treasures
can bring benefits from somewhere,

126
00:11:23,320 --> 00:11:26,879
then Xu Fan might prefer
to handle it himself,

127
00:11:27,519 --> 00:11:32,200
rather than trouble you
with passing it through your hands.

128
00:11:41,399 --> 00:11:43,320
(The past must eventually be faced)

129
00:11:54,639 --> 00:11:57,480
Now we must find
the Buddha Head before them

130
00:11:57,559 --> 00:11:59,120
to disrupt their cooperation.

131
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:01,759
This matter started
with Head Rong and your mother.

132
00:12:02,159 --> 00:12:03,879
Look through your mother's belongings.

133
00:12:04,159 --> 00:12:06,039
Maybe you can find some clues.

134
00:12:09,039 --> 00:12:11,480
This photo doesn't look like
it's from the Rongqing Troupe.

135
00:12:13,279 --> 00:12:17,440
It's from the old troupe that Mother
and Head Rong were in together.

136
00:12:18,960 --> 00:12:21,000
Could the Jade Buddha Head
be hidden there?

137
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,159
You didn't expect it, huh?

138
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:30,840
I had sent people
to watch the Jiang residence closely.

139
00:12:31,240 --> 00:12:36,600
Not a single move of yours
escaped my notice.

140
00:12:37,720 --> 00:12:38,519
Right.

141
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:43,360
I heard Rong Xiaonan has become
the Xiaosheng Society's honored guest.

142
00:12:43,679 --> 00:12:49,600
Xu You'an, being betrayed
doesn't feel pleasant, right?

143
00:12:51,960 --> 00:12:53,159
Kill me if you want.

144
00:12:53,799 --> 00:12:54,799
Stop wasting words.

145
00:12:58,080 --> 00:13:00,120
I went to all this trouble

146
00:13:00,120 --> 00:13:02,240
precisely to fulfill the bond
between you two brothers

147
00:13:04,799 --> 00:13:08,200
of dying on the same day,
same month, and same year.

148
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:21,840
Speak of the devil.

149
00:13:27,279 --> 00:13:31,279
Mr. Du. I heard this traitor
once offended you.

150
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:34,919
This is the Governor Mansion's
reply to you.

151
00:13:35,159 --> 00:13:36,679
You're too kind, Governor Xu.

152
00:13:37,240 --> 00:13:40,120
You know what I want most.

153
00:13:40,399 --> 00:13:43,360
I don't care who lives or dies.

154
00:13:44,960 --> 00:13:45,879
Mr. Du,

155
00:13:46,759 --> 00:13:50,000
why does it sound like
you're not quite satisfied with me?

156
00:13:51,679 --> 00:13:55,159
There must be someone sowing discord,

157
00:13:56,919 --> 00:13:58,960
saying things they shouldn't.

158
00:14:04,840 --> 00:14:06,720
I am Mr. Du's guest.

159
00:14:07,480 --> 00:14:09,559
Governor Xu, by targeting me like this,

160
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:12,840
shouldn't you ask Mr. Du if he agrees?

161
00:14:15,679 --> 00:14:19,039
As expected of an opera singer,
full of nonsense.

162
00:14:19,679 --> 00:14:22,320
I am eliminating
a hidden danger for Mr. Du.

163
00:14:23,159 --> 00:14:25,759
Your master died
at the hands of Mr. Du and me.

164
00:14:25,759 --> 00:14:27,200
How could you not hate us?

165
00:14:27,320 --> 00:14:28,759
Do you think I don't know?

166
00:14:29,440 --> 00:14:30,480
You're doing this

167
00:14:32,919 --> 00:14:35,240
to seek revenge, right?

168
00:14:38,759 --> 00:14:40,559
Governor Xu, you're really funny.

169
00:14:41,440 --> 00:14:44,360
My master died because of you
and that scoundrel Jiang Xiaoren.

170
00:14:44,799 --> 00:14:46,080
Why are you so determined

171
00:14:46,600 --> 00:14:50,440
to drag Mr. Du down with you?

172
00:14:52,039 --> 00:14:52,840
You!

173
00:14:53,519 --> 00:14:54,320
Enough.

174
00:14:57,120 --> 00:15:00,000
I don't have time to watch you two
put on a show here.

175
00:15:02,879 --> 00:15:05,440
Governor Xu, if you're sincere,

176
00:15:05,879 --> 00:15:08,559
just hand Xu You'an over to me.

177
00:15:10,519 --> 00:15:14,600
If you're not, then there's no need
to discuss cooperation further.

178
00:15:37,600 --> 00:15:39,120
Don't touch me with your filthy hands!

179
00:15:41,720 --> 00:15:44,759
Do you know what kind of path
you're walking now?

180
00:15:48,159 --> 00:15:50,039
You're acting as an accomplice,

181
00:15:50,600 --> 00:15:52,200
and that path ends in death.

182
00:15:55,240 --> 00:15:56,080
Xu You'an,

183
00:15:57,440 --> 00:15:59,240
we both have paths we must take.

184
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:02,000
The only thing I can do right now

185
00:16:04,600 --> 00:16:06,240
is to follow Mr. Du.

186
00:16:07,399 --> 00:16:10,039
Then I'd rather die
by the gun of a demon

187
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:15,279
than see you in such a filthy state now.

188
00:16:16,720 --> 00:16:19,639
You've sunk low enough
to run with that crowd.

189
00:16:20,639 --> 00:16:23,080
I tried to save you,
but I caused Yongnian's death.

190
00:16:24,360 --> 00:16:27,559
Every time I think of
how Yongnian died in front of me,

191
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:30,000
I wish I could kill you.

192
00:16:33,504 --> 00:16:37,125
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

193
00:16:37,125 --> 00:16:40,809
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

194
00:16:40,896 --> 00:16:45,440
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

195
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:48,080
If you want to die
for your foolish justice,

196
00:16:49,519 --> 00:16:51,399
then I'll send you on your way.

197
00:16:53,572 --> 00:16:57,193
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

198
00:16:57,193 --> 00:17:00,877
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

199
00:17:00,964 --> 00:17:05,892
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

200
00:17:05,892 --> 00:17:10,052
♪How can I bear to let go♪

201
00:17:33,760 --> 00:17:35,040
♪As if it were fate♪

202
00:17:35,040 --> 00:17:36,397
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

203
00:17:36,959 --> 00:17:40,196
♪We miss each other♪

204
00:17:41,440 --> 00:17:43,008
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

205
00:17:43,008 --> 00:17:45,408
♪And a bizarre♪

206
00:17:45,408 --> 00:17:48,210
♪Anonymous legend♪

207
00:17:48,740 --> 00:17:50,752
♪The plot twists and turns♪

208
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:52,640
♪Play out over and over again♪

209
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:55,704
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

210
00:17:56,285 --> 00:17:57,984
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

211
00:17:57,984 --> 00:17:58,976
♪Refuse to submit♪

212
00:17:58,976 --> 00:18:02,176
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

213
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:06,752
♪There are always too many♪

214
00:18:06,752 --> 00:18:08,640
♪Helpless situations♪

215
00:18:08,640 --> 00:18:11,264
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

216
00:18:12,395 --> 00:18:14,355
♪Even if I have questions♪

217
00:18:14,355 --> 00:18:16,355
♪I harbor desires♪

218
00:18:16,355 --> 00:18:19,232
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

219
00:18:19,583 --> 00:18:21,216
♪People come and go♪

220
00:18:21,216 --> 00:18:24,032
♪I'm still all alone♪

221
00:18:24,032 --> 00:18:26,760
♪Wandering around♪

222
00:18:27,008 --> 00:18:29,861
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

223
00:18:29,861 --> 00:18:34,322
♪Go through the entanglement♪

224
00:18:34,688 --> 00:18:36,416
♪If longing♪

225
00:18:36,416 --> 00:18:39,575
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

226
00:18:39,575 --> 00:18:42,330
♪How can I be at ease♪

227
00:18:42,432 --> 00:18:44,746
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

228
00:18:44,864 --> 00:18:46,720
♪And travelled around the world♪

229
00:18:46,816 --> 00:18:49,904
♪Scars all over me♪

230
00:18:50,176 --> 00:18:53,088
♪If longing never fades♪

231
00:18:53,088 --> 00:18:54,537
♪Burns still hot♪

232
00:18:54,537 --> 00:18:57,616
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

233
00:18:57,888 --> 00:18:59,745
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

234
00:18:59,808 --> 00:19:00,992
♪In the next life♪

235
00:19:00,992 --> 00:19:05,472
♪Entangle with you again♪
